35,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The receipts show we are buying the same spray twice. That is waste.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, the timing data is worse. A full pass takes over an hour.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Ryuji, that confirms my suspicion. The work is concentrated, but the blame is shared.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, I found the real issue. We have no shared definition of 'done'.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,"@May, that explains the tension. I found a note from the previous tenants.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Midori, what did the previous tenants do? I need to know the cost structure.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, the grout fails in eleven days. We need a schedule that accounts for that.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Ryuji, if the grout fails that fast, a weekly rotation is impossible.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, exactly. And the calendar shows we are often short-staffed.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Toshio, the note says they split rooms permanently. It ended in silence.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Midori, silence is not a solution. I need a clear cost breakdown.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, the cost is time. I need to know if outsourcing removes the hours.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Ryuji, outsourcing might remove the hours, but does it remove the resentment?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, resentment comes from the unknown. If we define 'done', we can trust it.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@May, I agree. I also checked the firm's terms. They need a tidy space.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Midori, if the firm needs a tidy space, we still have to clean.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, that is the trap. We need to know the true hourly cost.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Ryuji, let’s look at the options. We need a system that matches effort to usage.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, I want a system where I don’t have to guess.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Midori,,"@May, I want a system where we still talk. Let’s see the options.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
